---
description: >-
  A three-by-three grid with relations across it (#774): a2 -> c2 is
  upright and goes round B2 in one lane, and the diagonals a1 -> c3 and
  a3 -> c1, which no elbow of two bends can clear, go round B2 too
  instead of straight through it.
---
C4Container
title Blocked diagonal relations
UpdateLayoutConfig($c4ShapeInRow="3")
Container(a1, "A1")
Container(a2, "A2")
Container(a3, "A3")
Container(b1, "B1")
Container(b2, "B2")
Container(b3, "B3")
Container(c1, "C1")
Container(c2, "C2")
Container(c3, "C3")
Rel(a1, c3, "diagonal")
Rel(a2, c2, "down")
Rel(a3, c1, "diagonal")
